{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Bloxpath</strong> \u2014 a puzzle game centered around <i>rolling blocks</i>, inspired by the classic Flash game Bloxorz. If you love pure puzzle challenges or are tired of the monotony of pushing boxes, this game will bring you a whole new level of fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wealth of Puzzles to Solve</strong>: Includes <strong>approximately 200 meticulously designed puzzles</strong> and <strong>over 20 unique gameplay mechanics</strong>, featuring a large map divided into regions. Each region offers puzzles with distinct styles, challenging different aspects of your thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Core Mechanics</strong>: From simple block rolling to complex multi-block interactions, the gameplay progresses layer by layer, continuously sparking your curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tree-like Unlocking System</strong>: Puzzles are unlocked in a tree structure, allowing you to switch to other regions for exploration when stuck, keeping the game flow uninterrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Experience</strong>: Supports keyboard, mouse, and controller inputs, with input buffering and configurable repeat input delays to ensure smooth and fluid controls, letting you focus on solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Loading, Seamless Transitions</strong>: Except for the initial launch, the game has no loading screens throughout, with all scenes and animations switching in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Performance Optimization</strong>: With vertical sync turned off, the frame rate is fully unlocked, allowing players with high-refresh-rate monitors to enjoy the ultimate smoothness of block rolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Delight</strong>: The game is themed around blocks, with natural and smooth state transition animations and meticulously polished level transition effects, satisfying the aesthetic needs of OCD players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=516 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Design Philosophy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When creating Bloxpath, my goal was to immerse players in the pure joy of puzzle-solving without being bogged down by cumbersome rules. Here are my core principles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Not Overwhelming</strong>: Puzzles are designed to be concise and efficient, avoiding lengthy steps, with a moderate difficulty level suitable for players with puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong>: Early puzzles help you get familiar with the mechanics, while later ones challenge your inspiration and insight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Approaches</strong>: Puzzles in different regions have unique solutions, allowing you to experience a variety of puzzle-solving fun rather than a single routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=526 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Word from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a programmer, I am almost obsessive in my pursuit of performance and experience. Bloxpath is not just a puzzle game; it is my dedication to detail. From seamless scene transitions to smooth controls, every aspect has been crafted with care. I hope you find the thrill of puzzle-solving in the game and enjoy every &quot;aha&quot; moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tired of pushing boxes? Come roll some blocks and give your brain a new challenge!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Challenge Puzzle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/b5888c311ccdebf59154b7cbeacf146097025f34.jpg"},{"name":"Half way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/0b969b78dd379e72a3d07545d57ea7f84da7e18c.jpg"},{"name":"Little Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/2575eee93581f74ba62484f225d00ad65fdbdda7.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/7709cd2603589a26c9c0d5eba1f4025f79ba54d6.jpg"},{"name":"Klotski","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/de8e568c60ea75dd58acae424bd160715c1f4aa5.jpg"},{"name":"Mirror Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/08878579755f346a2a2ae8c7c1cce63bd2a22b85.jpg"},{"name":"Swap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/85608e27850bce209f7a5aa8d3782b64ca7ffe9c.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/610745aa1c9f8a1b527489eb4f23be0c8f78d41c.jpg"},{"name":"Roll A Dice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/77f76f32a7cbfeb4d10ccc551db7cb016d26bd71.jpg"},{"name":"End Of The Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3249900/80453324ec9b8c3a830c21e97235759318e32ab9.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249900?t=1748966697","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249900?t=1748966697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/3fc1efba8955a9835a4de87fdd07bb0215e3cde3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748966697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/3fc1efba8955a9835a4de87fdd07bb0215e3cde3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748966697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Bloxpath</strong> \u2014 a puzzle game centered around <i>rolling blocks</i>, inspired by the classic Flash game Bloxorz. If you love pure puzzle challenges or are tired of the monotony of pushing boxes, this game will bring you a whole new level of fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wealth of Puzzles to Solve</strong>: Includes <strong>approximately 200 meticulously designed puzzles</strong> and <strong>over 20 unique gameplay mechanics</strong>, featuring a large map divided into regions. Each region offers puzzles with distinct styles, challenging different aspects of your thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Core Mechanics</strong>: From simple block rolling to complex multi-block interactions, the gameplay progresses layer by layer, continuously sparking your curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tree-like Unlocking System</strong>: Puzzles are unlocked in a tree structure, allowing you to switch to other regions for exploration when stuck, keeping the game flow uninterrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Experience</strong>: Supports keyboard, mouse, and controller inputs, with input buffering and configurable repeat input delays to ensure smooth and fluid controls, letting you focus on solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Loading, Seamless Transitions</strong>: Except for the initial launch, the game has no loading screens throughout, with all scenes and animations switching in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Performance Optimization</strong>: With vertical sync turned off, the frame rate is fully unlocked, allowing players with high-refresh-rate monitors to enjoy the ultimate smoothness of block rolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Delight</strong>: The game is themed around blocks, with natural and smooth state transition animations and meticulously polished level transition effects, satisfying the aesthetic needs of OCD players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=516 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Design Philosophy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When creating Bloxpath, my goal was to immerse players in the pure joy of puzzle-solving without being bogged down by cumbersome rules. Here are my core principles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Not Overwhelming</strong>: Puzzles are designed to be concise and efficient, avoiding lengthy steps, with a moderate difficulty level suitable for players with puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong>: Early puzzles help you get familiar with the mechanics, while later ones challenge your inspiration and insight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Approaches</strong>: Puzzles in different regions have unique solutions, allowing you to experience a variety of puzzle-solving fun rather than a single routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=526 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Word from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a programmer, I am almost obsessive in my pursuit of performance and experience. Bloxpath is not just a puzzle game; it is my dedication to detail. From seamless scene transitions to smooth controls, every aspect has been crafted with care. I hope you find the thrill of puzzle-solving in the game and enjoy every &quot;aha&quot; moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tired of pushing boxes? Come roll some blocks and give your brain a new challenge!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["agoo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/header.jpg?t=1748966697","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3249900/2080571454/47ca81006cbf7c8d4c9f70ecce506c48470443e6/1750884584/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748792681","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3249900/2080571454/47ca81006cbf7c8d4c9f70ecce506c48470443e6/1750884584/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748792681","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3249900/2080571454/47ca81006cbf7c8d4c9f70ecce506c48470443e6/1750884584/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748792681","id":257149356,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149356/movie480.mp4?t=1748792681","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149356/movie_max.mp4?t=1748792681"},"name":"trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149356/2aca922b9d3babeb682dce342b1ee128268896ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748792681","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer